{"about_the_game":"This roguelike Tower Defense game will challenge your ability to keep your cool in a hectic battle.<br>Don't overextend your resources in one battle, as many will follow.<br>Be creative with your <strong>towers and spells</strong> and deal with your enemies efficiently to succeed!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/extras/e599ee2feabb67610c2a6c1254508d65.avif?t=1706021663\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/extras/c253340ae579702c7726fb4dd0dbbc5a.poster.avif?t=1706021663\" width=580 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/extras/c253340ae579702c7726fb4dd0dbbc5a.webm?t=1706021663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Explore different worlds: find new buildings to strengthen your defenses, learn new spells, or improve your economy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/extras/2fbb15b435ef8209e5cf7f6da8e768eb.avif?t=1706021663\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/extras/d6a407bf16b880021bb38257b949dff6.poster.avif?t=1706021663\" width=580 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/extras/d6a407bf16b880021bb38257b949dff6.webm?t=1706021663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Your resources are limited - every decision matters! Invest efficiently and choose wisely.<br><br>Not every strategy or tactic will lead to success. Experiment with different towers, spells, and their elements.<br>Your enemies are numerous and require different approaches to overcome them... ideally efficiently.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1818630?t=1706021663","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1818630?t=1706021663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1706021663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1706021663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Our Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This roguelike Tower Defense game will challenge your ability to keep your cool in a hectic battle.<br>Don't overextend your resources in one battle, as many will follow.<br>Be creative with your <strong>towers and spells</strong> and deal with your enemies efficiently to succeed!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/extras/e599ee2feabb67610c2a6c1254508d65.avif?t=1706021663\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/extras/c253340ae579702c7726fb4dd0dbbc5a.poster.avif?t=1706021663\" width=580 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818630/extras/c253340ae579702c7726fb4dd0dbbc5a.webm?t=1706021663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Explore different worlds: find new buildings to strengthen your defenses, learn new spells, or improve your economy.